    <publishedInSocialPlatform>Instagram</publishedInSocialPlatform>
    <hasCapturedMoment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTimeStamp">2024-08-05T19:05:54Z</hasCapturedMoment>
    <hasMoment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTimeStamp">2022-05-14T01:39:45Z</hasMoment>
    <hasSentimentScore rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.0516</hasSentimentScore>
    <hasTextContent>After a decade, recording the first time I'm going back to [REDACTED] and have a beer after, without using a [REDACTED]. It still hurts (and it's not a little), but between weakening the pain with [REDACTED] treatment, lifestyle changes, and personal growth, today, the pain didn't take away my smile, so I won this battle. A small victory, but one that I think is worthy of celebration</hasTextContent>
