    <hasExplanation>The text expresses gratitude and surprise, and it implicitly conveys feelings of regret for the delayed acknowledgment. These sentiments relate to gratitude and regret.</hasExplanation>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/spmh/ontologies/2024/3/SPMH/Mania">
